// Probe: arbitrary-precision integer arithmetic, OR documented fixed-width
// integer semantics together with a standard-library checked or wrapping
// arithmetic API.  Quidra 0.2.0 has fixed-width documented semantics, but the
// overflow response is a deterministic runtime abort (status 101), not a
// checked/wrapping API that returns a value to the program.
int m = 9223372036854775807
auto w = int.wrapping_add(m, 1)
auto c = int.checked_add(m, 1)
print("X24 {w} {c}")
